notes:
I found two real programs, both from Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre's own pages. The town's recreation page only turned up dance for ages 2 to 6, and I didn't find a toddler gymnastics class there.

```json
{
  "picks": [
    {
      "name": "Parent and Tot, Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre (36 Armstrong Avenue, Georgetown)",
      "age_fit": "18 months - 3.11 yrs, parent participates, 30 min class",
      "when": "Fall 2026 session Sept 12 - Dec 18. Their fall schedule PDF lists Saturday classes at 9:00-9:30, 9:35-10:05 and 10:15-10:45, plus weekday afternoon times. Registration opened July 20. I could not confirm whether spots are still open, since the session is under way.",
      "source_name": "Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre"
    },
    {
      "name": "Pre-school Drop In, Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre (36 Armstrong Avenue, Georgetown)",
      "age_fit": "Under 4, a parent stays with the child",
      "when": "Tuesdays and Thursdays 9:30am-12:00pm. No pre-registration, first come. The page's own start and end dates (Oct 9 to June 26) look carried over from a previous year, so I could not pin down this year's dates. No drop-in on statutory holidays.",
      "price": "$15 per parent, up to 4 children",
      "source_name": "Halton Hills Gymnastics Centre"
    }
  ]
