```

- **Parent and Tot:** the page doesn't post a price for the class, so I left it out. I read the Saturday times off a schedule table that was hard to line up by column, so call to confirm them.
- **Pre-school Drop In:** this runs on a school-year schedule, so it fits the fall to December window. Their fall PDF shows the Tuesday and Thursday 9:30-12:00 slots. Their page lists a closure from Dec 22 to Jan 5.
